      <activity id="c10564fc-b6f0-561e-9f0f-087b2970cc71" activityNameId="d7edb761-779c-5ea5-a058-18a41d156f55" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Planing mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Planing mill
The service life is assumed to be 50 years. Thus the life time output is 1'250'000 m3 planed timber. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for planing wood if this is not relevant.;
UUID: 87818db0-4fa9-310f-a87a-8a78dced9e87
The land area and the material and their transports needed for building and disposal of a planing mill with a yearly output of 25"000 m3 timber is included. The space for storing dried wood before and after planing and for packageing etc. is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium sized planing mill, located with sawmill
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_87818db0-4fa9-310f-a87a-8a78dced9e87.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
